## What I’ve Learned So Far
- How login systems actually work  
- How Flask handles GET and POST  
- How to connect a database to a web app  
- How user input gets checked against stored data  
- How to make more secure passwords using hashing  
- How to link a user to their own page after login 
- How to store data from login attempts
- How to dectect brtue froce attempts 
- How to assign difference role privilges based on user whose sign in
- How Flask remembers signed in users using sessions
- How Python interacts to SQLite databases
- How different users can have different permissions
- How tables, rows, and columns work in databases
